<section class="notes-content-section">
<div class="container">
  <p class="notes-intro-text" data-reveal>I don't publish to keep up a feed. These are the ideas I lead by, the ones that show up again and again in how I work, and most of them were learned the hard way. Execution keeps getting cheaper. Judgment is what's left. The work these notes shaped is in <a href="work.html">Work</a>.</p>
  <div class="notes-list">

    <a class="note-entry" href="notes/not-a-stroke-expert.html">
      <div class="note-pillar">Leadership · AI</div>
      <h3>I'm not a stroke expert</h3>
      <p>I built a clinical research tool in a weekend, in a field I'd never worked in - and what it taught me about judgment, problem-solving, and who I hire.</p>
      <div class="note-foot"><span class="note-meta"><span class="note-year">2026</span><span class="note-sep">&bull;</span><span class="note-time"><i class="fa-light fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> 5 min</span></span><span class="note-read">Read <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span></div>
    </a>

    <a class="note-entry" href="notes/two-opposite-pushes.html">
      <div class="note-pillar">Leadership</div>
      <h3>Two opposite pushes</h3>
      <p>On turning a design organization into AI-native builders - and why leading that change means coaching two opposite instincts at the very same time.</p>
      <div class="note-foot"><span class="note-meta"><span class="note-year">2025</span><span class="note-sep">&bull;</span><span class="note-time"><i class="fa-light fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> 3 min</span></span><span class="note-read">Read <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span></div>
    </a>

    <a class="note-entry" href="notes/play-stay-messy.html">
      <div class="note-pillar">Leadership · AI</div>
      <h3>Play, stay messy, share</h3>
      <p>I'm not an AI expert; I'm learning alongside my team. What I know is teaching - and why moving an org forward starts with permission to play.</p>
      <div class="note-foot"><span class="note-meta"><span class="note-year">2025</span><span class="note-sep">&bull;</span><span class="note-time"><i class="fa-light fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> 4 min</span></span><span class="note-read">Read <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span></div>
    </a>

    <a class="note-entry" href="notes/vision-is-a-floor.html">
      <div class="note-pillar">Leadership · Product</div>
      <h3>Vision is a floor, not a ceiling</h3>
      <p>A vision isn't meant to be admired or obeyed. It's a direction clear enough that the teams who build it can make it better than you ever drew.</p>
      <div class="note-foot"><span class="note-meta"><span class="note-year">2024</span><span class="note-sep">&bull;</span><span class="note-time"><i class="fa-light fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> 2 min</span></span><span class="note-read">Read <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span></div>
    </a>

    <a class="note-entry" href="notes/it-was-never-the-org-chart.html">
      <div class="note-pillar">Leadership</div>
      <h3>It was never the org chart</h3>
      <p>When the leader of an eighty-engineer program left, I was asked to hold the wheel for a while. Eight weeks later, they quietly stopped looking.</p>
      <div class="note-foot"><span class="note-meta"><span class="note-year">2021</span><span class="note-sep">&bull;</span><span class="note-time"><i class="fa-light fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> 2 min</span></span><span class="note-read">Read <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span></div>
    </a>

    <a class="note-entry" href="notes/teaching.html">
      <div class="note-pillar">Leadership</div>
      <h3>Teaching taught me to manage</h3>
      <p>I didn't become a better manager by getting promoted. I became one standing in front of a classroom, years before I ever had the title.</p>
      <div class="note-foot"><span class="note-meta"><span class="note-year">2017</span><span class="note-sep">&bull;</span><span class="note-time"><i class="fa-light fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> 3 min</span></span><span class="note-read">Read <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span></div>
    </a>

